WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:09.710
Andjelka, you know what? I watched a documentary about how every person has a mental or physical trait of some animal.

2
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.070
Really? – I swear, it's scientifically proven.

3
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.350
Really? You know, I really feel that I'm some kind of panther.

4
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.890
What did you say you are? – A panther. – You're a panther? – Come on, a cat.

5
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:26.610
A panther is, well, brave, lean, runs fast, thinks fast, intelligent, eats meat.

6
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.930
You eat meat once a week. In fact you only ever eat vegetables.

7
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:36.410
Well, okay, maybe I'm something a bit more elegant. Some little swan.

8
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:40.970
Andje, don't be angry, but you're far from a swan.

9
00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:48.630
What? – A swan is elegant, noble, always goes in one direction, at the same speed, calm. You don't know where you're going, left or right.

10
00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.550
A hysterical woman, not a swan.

11
00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.410
Well, okay, what am I then? I'm really curious, so, what am I according to you.

12
00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:58.630
If you want me to be honest... Just don't get angry.

13
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:02.570
You, my love, are a seal. And a baby seal at that.

14
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:09.030
What? – Well, you have those big bulging eyes, and you're sweet like a little seal, you get it?

15
00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:14.850
Then it lies like this, look, lies like this helpless, waiting for someone to give it something, and so do you, you get it?

16
00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:21.110
And you always have to watch over them, cuddle them, take care of them, otherwise they'll croak.

17
00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.670
So you are, believe me, a baby seal, and that's better, believe me, than a granny seal.

18
00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:32.240
Be happy. And you, man, you're exactly a gorilla, I swear.

19
00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.260
But I'm not hairy. – So what if you're not hairy, what does it matter, you have all the other traits.

20
00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:42.160
A big fat beast that just sits and looks at other women, picks its nose, scratches its balls, you're a gorilla.

21
00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.360
So, love, now we're going to look at the monkeys, to meet the family.

22
00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.840
Don't you listen to her.

23
00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.200
Your brother is a lion.

24
00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.500
Don't listen to him at all. Come on, jump in the pool to hang out with the family a bit, please.

25
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:08.220
And I swear, we'll give you fish to eat.
